@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@* Deliberately service-free.

   MainLayout injects OrganizationConfigService and reads the org name from
   the database on every render so a rename shows up without a re-login.
   That is fine for ordinary pages, but /Error is re-executed by
   UseExceptionHandler precisely when something has already failed — and the
   failure we most need to survive is "the database is unreachable". A layout
   that queries the database would throw while rendering the page whose whole
   job is to explain the failure, and the reader would get the framework's
   bare unhandled-exception response with no reference id to quote.

   So this layout injects nothing and awaits nothing. Anything added here must
   keep that property. See issue #559. *@

<div class="minimal-layout">
    <a href="/" class="minimal-layout__brand" aria-label="AL Dev Toolbox home">
        <Icon Name="hammer" Css="minimal-layout__logo" Width="22" Height="22" />
        <span>AL Dev Toolbox</span>
    </a>

    <main class="minimal-layout__content">
        @Body
    </main>
</div>
